    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1103">

                <pb facs="0934" n="818" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg818"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/16673.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Douglas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-02T18:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 2, 1915—6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Villa has moved up more artillery. Desultory firing has already commenced.
                    General Funston held short conference with Villa this morning.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carothers.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
